                                                    <img class="lazyload quote_most_reviewec_img" src="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/assets2/desktop_view/assets/icon/ajax-loader.svg" data-src="https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_logo/forex_fury_logo.png" alt="company logo">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">The ability to use a vps is important for automated trading</div>
                                        <p>Running an EA continuously through a VPS can provide a more stable environment than leaving a personal computer running around the clock. This is especially relevant for traders who want consistent execution without worrying about their home computer going offline.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="item">
                                <a class="card_slider_outer_main" href="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/proxyline" target="_self" rel="noopener">
                                    <div class="header_card_slider_main">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-8">
                                                <div class="d-flex">
                                                    <div class="profile_circle_black" style="background-image:url('https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_review_image/mechnikovartur-20260809011916.jpg');"></div>
                                                    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
                                                        <span>Mechnikov Artur</span>
                                                        <p>Software Architect</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-4 top_most_review_month_div">
                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center image_outer_slider">
                                                    <img class="lazyload quote_most_reviewec_img" src="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/assets2/desktop_view/assets/icon/ajax-loader.svg" data-src="https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_logo/proxyline-20251218180116.png" alt="company logo">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">ProxyLine for automated scripts. Short-term proxy rental</div>
                                        <p>I have used ProxyLine with several automated scripts where requests needed to be distributed across different IP addresses. The setup was fairly straightforward, and I could choose the required location before ordering the proxies. HTTP and SOCKS5 support made it possible to use the same service with different tools. The API is also useful when proxy management needs to be integrated into a script instead of being handled manually. I liked being able to replace individual IPs when necessary. The main drawback is that managing a larger number of addresses would be easier with better filtering and grouping options.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="item">
                                <a class="card_slider_outer_main" href="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/whatsapp-messenger" target="_self" rel="noopener">
                                    <div class="header_card_slider_main">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-8">
                                                <div class="d-flex">
                                                    <div class="profile_circle_black" style="background-image:url('https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_review_image/muhammadzaid-20260804235631.png');"></div>
                                                    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
                                                        <span>Muhammad zaid</span>
                                                        <p>Content Writer</p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-4 top_most_review_month_div">
                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center image_outer_slider">
                                                    <img class="lazyload quote_most_reviewec_img" src="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/assets2/desktop_view/assets/icon/ajax-loader.svg" data-src="https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_logo/1589543124_whatsapp messenger.jpg" alt="company logo">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">Best app for daily communication and business</div>
                                        <p>WhatsApp Messenger is the most reliable messaging app I have used for over 2 years. I use it daily to chat with clients, friends and family. What I like most is that it is completely free to use with no ads. Voice calls and video calls are very clear even on slow internet. WhatsApp Business features help me manage customer messages easily. End-to-end encryption makes it secure. Status and group features are very useful. What I dislike is that sometimes media files take time to download and there is a limit on forwarding messages. Overall, WhatsApp has made communication very easy and fast. I highly recommend it for both personal and professional use.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="item">
                                <a class="card_slider_outer_main" href="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/work-time" target="_self" rel="noopener">
                                    <div class="header_card_slider_main">
