                                            <div class="col-8">
                                                <div class="d-flex">
                                                    <div class="profile_circle_black" style="background-image:url('https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_review_image/kristenziemerutherford-20260819222656.png');"></div>
                                                    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center">
                                                        <span>Kristen Zieme-Rutherford</span>
                                                        <p></p>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-4 top_most_review_month_div">
                                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center image_outer_slider">
                                                    <img class="lazyload quote_most_reviewec_img" src="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/assets2/desktop_view/assets/icon/ajax-loader.svg" data-src="https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_logo/1616507934_logo-300-worktime-linkedin.jpg" alt="company logo">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">Reliable data has kept us using WorkTime for years</div>
                                        <p>Overall, my experience with WT has been very positive. The reasons behind that come down to the strengths Ive highlighted below; data accuracy has always been the deciding factor for me. Everything else is secondary as long as I can rely on the info the platform provides.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                                                    <div class="item">
                                <a class="card_slider_outer_main" href="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/spaceproxy" target="_self" rel="noopener">
                                    <div class="header_card_slider_main">
                                        <div class="row">
                                            <div class="col-8">
                                                <div class="d-flex">
                                                    <div class="profile_circle_black" style="background-image:url('https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_review_image/mechnikovartur-20260823171209.jpg');"></div>
