                                                    <img class="lazyload quote_most_reviewec_img" src="https://www.softwaresuggest.com/assets2/desktop_view/assets/icon/ajax-loader.svg" data-src="https://images.softwaresuggest.com/software_logo/spaceproxy-20251218183616.png" alt="company logo">
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">Spaceproxy for a distributed development team</div>
                                        <p>Our development work sometimes involves checking services from several geographic locations. SpaceProxy made this easier because the required IPs could be prepared in advance and managed through one account. Different team members can use separate addresses for their testing tasks, which reduces conflicts between environments. I also found the short rental options useful when an IP was only needed during a particular development phase. The dashboard handles the basic management without unnecessary complexity. The main thing that requires attention is keeping track of which IP is assigned to which task when several developers are working with the same proxy account.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                            </div>
