                                    <div class="body_card_slider">
                                        <div class="title">Ensuring complete peace of mind right at the gate</div>
                                        <p>Knowing that every entry is logged, QR-approved, and monitored is reassuring for residents. From an ERP perspective, the platform integrates these logs with financial and administrative dashboards, giving committee members a complete view of operations. Maintenance dues, defaulter tracking, and bulk invoice postings are seamlessly connected, making administration efficient. SLA reports help track staff and vendor efficiency. This integration ensures both residents and committees feel informed, in control, and confident that processes are transparent and automated.</p>
